	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>Gratiam et pacem a deo patre et domino nostro Iesu Christo.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z2"/>Amen.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Principio ago gratias, vir ornatissime, patri domini nostri <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>Iesu Christi, qui me <foreign xml:lang="el">τὸν οὐρανοπέτην</foreign> notum et amicum fecit ac <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>reddidit praesertim iis, per quos tanquam instrumenta media euangelion <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>Christi filii ab aeterno geniti partim patefecit partim vero indies <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>magis magisque patefacit ecclesiae suae per universum orbem sparsę, <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>quemadmodum se manifestari voluit per patriarchas, prophetas et <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>apostolos.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Quorum e numero, tu vir clarissime, mihi praecipuus occurris <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>ac proinde in amicis meis maxime colendus.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Saepe equidem <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>optavi coram videre ecclesiam ac bene constitutam rempublicam vestram, <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>in qua, quemadmodum habet Paulus, <foreign xml:lang="el">εὐσχημόνως τε καὶ εὐπρ<lb xml:id="p1z12"/>οσεδρώς πάντα γίνεται</foreign>.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Ad quam invisendam aliquoties <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>cohortor auditores meos, quemadmodum noverunt ex adolescentibus <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>vestris, qui me dialectica <persName>Philippi</persName> praelegentem audiunt.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Saepe opta<lb xml:id="p1z15"/>vi, inquam, sed hactenus impedivit <foreign xml:lang="el">λῃθιατίς τε καὶ ποδάγρα</foreign>, <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>hostes perennes mei, quos tamen libenter sustineo secundum quod spiritum <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>patientię mihi impertit dominus <foreign xml:lang="el">ὁ παντοδύναμος</foreign>, et agnosco pater<lb xml:id="p1z18"/>nam erga me peccatorem miserum <foreign xml:lang="el">τοῦ αὐτοκράτορος πρὸς ἡμ<lb xml:id="p1z19"/>ᾶς</foreign> mentem <foreign xml:lang="el">ἀνθρωποπαθῶς λέγω</foreign>, qui ultra, quam <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>ferre possumus, neminem tentat.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Quoniam ergo vestras humanitates <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>coram cernere non licet visu corporeo, interim tamen mente vos <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>video et audio, dum scripta vestra diligenter ac sedulo evolvo, cum<lb xml:id="p1z23"/>primis autem tua, vir humanissime.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Quae enim hactenus habere potui <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>in Novum Testamentum (habeo autem excellentię tuae c<lb xml:id="p1z25"/>omme<lb xml:id="p1z26"/>n<lb xml:id="p1z27"/>tarios <pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>in univ<lb xml:id="p2z2"/>ersum <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>Nov<lb xml:id="p2z4"/>um Test<lb xml:id="p2z5"/>ament<lb xml:id="p2z6"/>um, cu<lb xml:id="p2z7"/>i nup<lb xml:id="p2z8"/>er adces<lb xml:id="p2z9"/>sit luculent<lb xml:id="p2z10"/>a en<lb xml:id="p2z11"/>arra<lb xml:id="p2z12"/>tio <lb xml:id="p2z13"/>Apocal<lb xml:id="p2z14"/>ypse<lb xml:id="p2z15"/>os a<lb xml:id="p2z16"/>posto<lb xml:id="p2z17"/>li ac ev<lb xml:id="p2z18"/>angelis<lb xml:id="p2z19"/>tae Ioan<lb xml:id="p2z20"/>nis), in his m<lb xml:id="p2z21"/>e oblect<lb xml:id="p2z22"/>o animęqu<lb xml:id="p2z23"/>e re<lb xml:id="p2z25"/>qu<lb xml:id="p2z26"/>iem quaer<lb xml:id="p2z27"/>o.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Adh<pb/><lb xml:id="p3z1"/>ibeo e<lb xml:id="p3z2"/>tiam <persName ref="p8111">Petr<lb xml:id="p3z3"/>i Martyr<lb xml:id="p3z6"/>i<lb xml:id="p3z7"/>s</persName>, doc<pb/><lb xml:id="p4z1"/>tissimi vir<lb xml:id="p4z2"/>i, [<lb xml:id="p4z3"/>.<lb xml:id="p4z4"/>.<lb xml:id="p4z5"/>.]<note type="misc">Schluss von T. Schieß nicht abgeschrieben.</note></s>
				</p>
